Cell["\<\
From an origin the intervals of the order are the supports of the segments. \
On a directed acyclic graph an implied edge changes nothing.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4a29dcf2-3d58-4a54-b271-aee69e99812d"],

